4. Audio Builder's own compilations
------------------------------------
The Audio Builder car subwoofer database (data/drivers/library/car-subs.json, raw records in data/car_subs_raw/), the car
speaker database (car-drivers.json, data/car_drivers_raw/), the earlier high-power car subwoofer database
(hp-car-subs.json, data/hp_subs_raw/), the car audio parts database (data/parts/, data/parts_raw/) and the generic board
sheet list (data/boards/generic_sheets.json) are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . The licence covers the selection and arrangement only. The values are the
manufacturers' published specifications (facts), each record keeps its source (maker URL or document, and the date
read); if you reuse the data, credit the database and keep each record's source. Only numbers, model names and source
links are recorded: no text, images or documents of the makers.

The public repository does not contain retailer prices or supplier catalogues. The app works without them and then shows
no prices.


5. Trademarks and no affiliation
--------------------------------
Brand and model names are trademarks of their owners and are used only to identify the products. Audio Builder is not
